Galerkin runs: n = 32, nu = 0.02, dt = 0.004, A = 1.0, seed = 7; dealiased 2/3 rule (cutoff k_max = 10.67); snapshots every 25 steps (delta = 0.1); viscous time at the forcing scale 1/(nu*k_f^2) = 50: phase A = 4x it (as N04c), phase B = 6.4x it.
Runs per phase: classical (no drag), a0cap (capped dry drag |d| <= 0.02) -- the undamped classes. cd-0.3 skipped (already equilibrated in N04b).
